message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SR / EBM Search Toolkit: Proximity Builder, PICO Strategy Builder, Search Syntax Converter, and PubMed Light"
abstract: >-
  A set of four browser-based tools for systematic-review literature searching:
  a Proximity Builder that assembles adjacency/near fragments from synonym stacks,
  a PICO Strategy Builder that generates line-numbered strategies with controlled
  vocabulary mapping, a Search Syntax Converter that translates a query across
  seven databases/platforms, and PubMed Light, which builds PubMed searches row by
  row with MeSH suggestions, one-click synonyms (Entry Terms), hierarchy browsing
  and live PubMed counts. All tools run in the browser; only MeSH lookups and PubMed
  counts are sent to the official NLM MeSH services and NCBI E-utilities API.
